\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces The light flavor jet and $c$ jet rejection factors as a function of the $b$ tagging efficiency for DL1r as well as the low-level taggers RNNIP, SVKine, and JFKine. The ratio of light and $c$ jet rejection rates are shown in the two lower panels. $f_c$ denotes the effective $c$ jet fraction in the background hypothesis~\blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {FTAG-2019-07}.}}{30}{figure.caption.16}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.2}{\ignorespaces Illustration of the several jet energy calibration steps. Each correction is applied to the jet four-momentum~\blx@tocontentsinit {0}\cite {JETM-2018-05}.}}{31}{figure.caption.18}%
